<http://madrid.events.com/event/11769483> <http://schema.org/startDate> "2024-10-17T00:00:00Z" .
<http://madrid.events.com/event/11769483> <http://schema.org/url> "http://www.madrid.es/sites/v/index.jsp?vgnextchannel=ca9671ee4a9eb410VgnVCM100000171f5a0aRCRD&vgnextoid=7d99af6138133810VgnVCM2000001f4a900aRCRD" .
