<http://madrid.events.com/event/12397727> <http://madrid.events.com/hasPlace> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Biblioteca%20P%C3%BAblica%20Municipal%20Mario%20Vargas%20Llosa%20%28Centro%29> .
