<http://madrid.events.com/event/12514294> <http://madrid.events.com/hasPlace> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Biblioteca%20P%C3%BAblica%20Municipal%20Francisco%20Ib%C3%A1%C3%B1ez%20%28Chamart%C3%ADn%29> .
