<http://madrid.events.com/event/12518162> <http://madrid.events.com/hasPlace> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Nave%2010%20Matadero.%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20Dram%C3%A1tica%20Contempor%C3%A1nea> .
