<http://madrid.events.com/event/12537163> <http://schema.org/isAccessibleForFree> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#Boolean> .
<http://madrid.events.com/event/12537163> <http://schema.org/name> "La Improvisación De Versalles" .
<http://madrid.events.com/event/12537163> <http://schema.org/startDate> "2024-10-24T00:00:00Z" .
