<http://madrid.events.com/event/12540087> <http://madrid.events.com/hasPlace> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Biblioteca%20P%C3%BAblica%20Municipal%20Jos%C3%A9%20Saramago%20%28Fuencarral-El%20Pardo%29> .
