<http://madrid.events.com/event/12542655> <http://madrid.events.com/hasPlace> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Biblioteca%20P%C3%BAblica%20Municipal%20Ana%20Mar%C3%ADa%20Matute%20%28Carabanchel%29> .
