<http://madrid.events.com/event/12543811> <http://madrid.events.com/excludedDays> "21/10/2024;28/10/2024;4/11/2024;11/11/2024;18/11/2024;25/11/2024;2/12/2024;9/12/2024;16/12/2024;23/12/2024;30/12/2024;" .
<http://madrid.events.com/event/12543811> <http://madrid.events.com/hasPlace> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Museo%20de%20Historia%20de%20Madrid> .
