<http://madrid.events.com/installation/Centro%20ASPA%201.%20%C3%81mbito%20de%20actuaci%C3%B3n%3A%20Tetu%C3%A1n%2C%20Centro%2C%20Chamber%C3%AD%2C%20Chamart%C3%ADn%20y%20Salamanca./geo> <http://schema.org/latitude> "4.045.312.576.018.930"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#Float> .
