<http://madrid.events.com/installation/Centro%20de%20Atenci%C3%B3n%20a%20la%20Infancia%20CAI%209%20Fuencarral-El%20Pardo%20%2F%20Moncloa-Aravaca> <http://madrid.events.com/hasContactDetails> <http://madrid.events.com/installation/Centro%20de%20Atenci%C3%B3n%20a%20la%20Infancia%20CAI%209%20Fuencarral-El%20Pardo%20%2F%20Moncloa-Aravaca/contact> .
<http://madrid.events.com/installation/Centro%20de%20Atenci%C3%B3n%20a%20la%20Infancia%20CAI%209%20Fuencarral-El%20Pardo%20%2F%20Moncloa-Aravaca> <http://madrid.events.com/openingHours> "De lunes a jueves de 8 a 15 horas y de 16 a 20 horas. Viernes, de 8 a 15 horas." .
